78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, I respect your caution, but the staffing reality is undeniable. Plan C is the only one we can actually maintain. I stand by my vote for C.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shizue, your caution is noted, but the data is clear. The ground and the budget both point to C. I stand by my vote for C.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
